or multi-stage rollouts.\n9. **Observability.** Error messages on `ValueError` clearly describe whether input type was invalid or string format did not match expected duration pattern.\n10. **Naming and dead code.** `parse_duration` matches ticket naming; all helper constants are used.\n\nGRUMP: APPROVE — utils.py, tests/test_utils.py\nFine.","stderr":"","at":"2026-09-05T05:40:56.642Z"}
